{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54026","headline":"辞北堂颂二首 一 · 良价","name":"辞北堂颂二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未了心源度数春，翻嗟浮世谩逡巡。\n几人得道空门里，独我淹留在世尘。\n谨具尺书辞眷爱，愿明大法报慈亲。\n不须洒泪频相忆，譬似当初无我身。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}